      "message": "If we set openflags as FSAL_O_WRITE in ceph_fsal_lease_op2(), then related_fd-\u003eopenflags matches with openflag.\n\nIf we set openflags as FSAL_O_RDWR in ceph_fsal_lease_op2(), then related_fd-\u003eopenflags won\u0027t match with openflag and further reopen_fsal_fd() will be called in order to match open mode and desired mode.",
